{{!
    @template tool_vae/provenance

    The provenance line of a certification record: who publishes it, under which licence, published on which day (or
    that it is not published yet).

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\provenance. The template holds no logic. Every
    value is escaped (double braces): none of them is HTML.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * text - string, the sentence of provenance

    Example context (json):
    {
        "text": "Source: France compétences, Licence Ouverte 2.0, published on 1 June 2026."
    }
}}
<div class="small text-muted">{{text}}</div>
